    "section5Title": "服務可用性與配额",
    "section5Content": "Deveng may change feature availability and reasonable per-server quotas to keep the Service reliable. Core tools are available without fees from this dashboard; limits exist to keep the service reliable.",
    "section6Title": "6. 智慧財產權",
    "section6Content": "Deveng Group 擁有服務、品牌和文檔，並受第三方和開源許可（如有說明）的約束。我們授予您有限的、可撤銷的許可，以按預期使用服務。您不得複製我們的面板使用者介面、大規模破壞我們的基礎設施或歪曲與 Deveng Group 的關係。",
