  "privacy": {
    "title": "隱私權政策",
    "lastUpdated": "最後更新：2026 年 5 月",
    "backToHome": "回到家",
    "termsLink": "服務條款",
    "section1Title": "1. 我們收集的數據",
    "section1Content": "當您使用Discord登入時，我們會收到來自Discord的基本個人資料資訊（使用者名稱、個人資料、伺服器清單）以驗證您的身分。此數據僅用於提供服務。",
    "section2Title": "2. 數據的使用",
    "section2Content": "When you sign in with Discord OAuth, we receive identifiers and profile information Discord shares with us (such as user ID, username, avatar, email when provided by Discord, and the list of guilds you share for authorization). We also process technical data (IP address, user agent, timestamps) for security and service reliability, and configuration data you save in the panel. Bank credential handling is outside the scope of this dashboard.",
    "section3Title": "3. 資料安全",
    "section3Content": "存取令牌和敏感資訊被安全儲存。通訊透過HTTPS進行加密。",
    "section4Title": "4. 您的權利",
    "section4Content": "We use service providers for hosting, databases, logging, and analytics. Subprocessors process data on our instructions under appropriate agreements. We may disclose information if required by law or to protect rights, safety, and the integrity of the Services.",
    "section5Title": "5. Cookie 和存儲",
    "section5Content": "The panel uses cookies and similar technologies for authentication, security, and preferences (such as theme and language). You can control cookies through your browser; blocking strictly necessary cookies may break sign-in.",
    "section6Title": "6. 國際轉帳",
    "section6Content": "如果資料在您所在國家/地區以外的國家/地區處理，我們會根據需要使用適當的保護措施（例如標準合約條款）或依賴充分性決策。",
    "section7Title": "7. Retention",
    "section7Content": "我們僅在提供服務、解決爭議、執行協議和履行法律義務所需的時間內保留資料。您可以在經過驗證和法律例外的情況下要求刪除。",
    "section8Title": "8. 您的權利；接觸",
    "section8Content": "Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, or object to certain processing, and to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. To exercise privacy rights: privacy@deveng.global. General support: support@deveng.global. Help server: https://discord.gg/deveng-bot",
